  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Accountant)\n\n### Log into a client’s Capium 365 portal.\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 22 Jul, 2025 at 10:14 AM\n\n\t\tLog into a client’s Capium 365 portal\n\nTo access a client's Capium 365 dashboard, accountants and their staff should follow these steps:\n\nNavigate to the Manage section within the platform.\n\nHover over the relevant client row to reveal the quick action menu.\n\nClick on the second icon from the left in the hover menu (typically represented by the Capium 365 logo or dashboard icon).\n\nYou will then be redirected to that client's Capium 365 Dashboard.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
